  "definition": "Exemptions",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-07-25",
  "historyNote": "#7381, eff 10-24-00; ss by #7860, eff 3-31-03, EXPIRED: 3-31-11 New. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 507.01); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
